      "id": "2073507867911659650",
      "text": "CAN YOU BELIEVE CLAUDE CODE DID THIS? 🤯\n\nA designer just dropped a showreel of client websites — every single one built with Claude Code.\n\nNot mockups. Shipped, live, animated sites 👇\n\n🎨 Kinetic typography that moves like a $10K agency intro\n🏗️ Real client work: doors company, personal brands, product sites\n⚡ The pipeline: from sketch to shipped — one tool, no handoff\n🧠 “Own the whole stack” — design, code, motion, deploy\n\nThe setup behind work like this is stupidly simple:\n\ncurl -fsSL https://t.co/TwSPt2eanX | bash\nnpx skills add ppakaus/Impeccable\n\nOne install. One design skill. Then you describe the site like you’d brief a contractor — and Claude writes the layout, the animations, the responsive breakpoints.\n\n💰 The math nobody wants to say out loud:\n\n→ Agencies charge $3-10K per site like these\n→ Claude Code ships one in an afternoon\n→ The showreel IS the sales pitch — post your builds, clients come to you\n\nDesigners used to need developers.\n\nDevelopers used to need designers.\n\nNow one person with Claude Code is both 🚀\n\nLET’S BUILD SOMETHING GOOD.",
