    {
      "id": "2072611184403226874",
      "text": "This non-coder literally grew 4 websites from zero using Claude AI SEO. One hit 275 clicks a day.\n\nNo programming. No SEO team. Just systems built with Claude.\n\nHere's the full stack:\n\n→ A research tool that scans Google Search Console for keywords with impressions but ZERO clicks\n\n→ Those gaps become dedicated landing pages\n\n→ A saved skill tells Claude the exact tone, structure, and rules every time\n\n→ One click publishes to Netlify or WordPress\n\n→ IndexNow gets it indexed fast, so new sites don't sit invisible\n\nAnd the secret weapon: a trend Oracle.\n\nIt pulls trending topics from X every 24 hours.\n\nNew keywords = low competition = easy rankings.\n\n\"Claude Fable 5 comeback\" is trending RIGHT NOW. Almost nobody has content for it.\n\nThe best part? He didn't even write the skill.\n\nHe told Claude: \"Watch how I make content. Save it as a skill. Repeat it forever.\"\n\nFind the recipe once. Deploy it to every site you own.\n\nWant the SOP? DM me. 💬",
